T*("white only" or "minority only," or even)Tj
T*(approximations to such schools. Hundreds)Tj
T*(of millions of dollars have been poured)Tj
T*(into the construction and renovation of)Tj
T*(schools and into programs designed to)Tj
T*(extirpate the traces of unlawful)Tj
T*(segregation. Although minority)Tj
T*(educational achievement lags behind that)Tj
T*(of whites, there is no evidence that the)Tj
T*(lag is any greater in Rockford than in)Tj
T*(otherwise similar districts that have no)Tj
T*(history of racial discrimination.)Tj
T*()Tj
T*(  Four years ago almost to the day we)Tj
T*(noted the absence of "evidence that the)Tj
T*(gap in scholastic achievement between)Tj
T*(white and minority students in Rockford)Tj
T*(is any greater than the gap between white)Tj
T*(and minority students in school districts)Tj
T*(that have not been found to have)Tj
T*(discriminated against their black and)Tj
T*(Hispanic students." 111 F.3d at 537. One)Tj
T*(might have expected the plaintiffs to)Tj
T*(take the hint and look for such evidence.)Tj
T*(If they have looked, they have found)Tj
T*(nothing. Although peppered with)Tj
T*(references to programs designed to)Tj
T*(achieve "vestige elimination," the)Tj
T*(plaintiffs' brief cites no evidence that)Tj
T*(there are vestiges of unlawful)Tj
T*(discrimination still to eliminate. "At)Tj
T*(some point," moreover, "the continuing)Tj
T*(and ineliminable traces of an earlier)Tj
T*(violation are too slight to justify)Tj
T*(continued federal judicial control of)Tj
T*(public education." United States v. Board)Tj
T*(of School Commissioners, supra, 128 F.3d)Tj
T*(at 511.)Tj
T*()Tj
T*(  The reality is that until minority)Tj
T*(students achieve parity of educational)Tj
T*(achievement with the white students in)Tj
T*(the Rockford public schools, the)Tj
T*(plaintiffs will contend that the minority)Tj
T*(students are victims of the unlawful)Tj
T*(discrimination of an earlier period in)Tj
T*(Rockford's history. Yet it is obvious)Tj
T*(that other factors besides discrimination)Tj
T*(contribute to unequal educational)Tj
T*(attainment, such as poverty, parents')Tj
T*(education and employment, family size,)Tj
T*(parental attitudes and behavior,)Tj
T*(prenatal, neonatal, and child health)Tj
T*(care, peer-group pressures, and ethnic)Tj
T*(culture. Some of these factors may)Tj
T*(themselves be due to or exacerbated by)Tj
T*(discrimination, but not to discrimination)Tj
T*(by the Rockford school board. The board)Tj
T*(has no legal duty to remove those)Tj
T*(vestiges of societal discrimination for)Tj
